📗
  📨 An incoming HTTP request (HttpRequest / express req).

  Build one by hand for tests with 🆕📨 🔤GET🔤 🔤/todos?done=true🔤❗️. Header
  names are case-insensitive, and a header or a query name may repeat. Route
  parameters are filled in by 🧭.
