  📗 Turns *rawQuery* into decoded pairs, keeping order and repeats. 📗
  🔒❗️ 🎏 rawQuery 🔡 ➡️ 👌 🍇
    🔂 pair 🔫 rawQuery 🔤&🔤❗️ 🍇
      ✌️🐇🧰 pair 🔤=🔤❗️ ➡️ kv
      ↪️ 📏 kv❓ ▶️ 0 🍇
        🐽 kv 0❗️ ➡️ rawKey
        ↪️ 📐 rawKey❗️ ▶️ 0 🍇
          ↪️ 🧺🐇🧰 rawKey❗️ ➡️ key 🍇
            🔤🔤 ➡️ 🖍🆕value
            ↪️ 📏 kv❓ ▶️ 1 🍇
              ↪️ 🧺🐇🧰 🐽 kv 1❗️❗️ ➡️ decodedValue 🍇
                decodedValue ➡️ 🖍value
              🍉
              🙅 🍇
                🔤the query has a bad percent-escape🔤 ➡️ 🖍problem
                ↩️ 👎
              🍉
            🍉
            🐻 queryKeys key❗️
            🐻 queryValues value❗️
          🍉
          🙅 🍇
            🔤the query has a bad percent-escape🔤 ➡️ 🖍problem
            ↩️ 👎
          🍉
        🍉
      🍉
    🍉
    ↩️ 👍
